<object #runtime.flow.snapshot {
    kind = "entity"
    fact_grade = "checkpoint_snapshot"
    single_writer = "modeling://runtime/flow/scheduler"
    derived_from = "modeling://domain/flow/runtime_lifecycle"
  } [
    <desc ?>WorkFlow/BizProcess 的 snapshot 是可恢复运行事实，不得回写 flow definition。</?>
    <types ?t>interface FlowSnapshot { treeId: string; tickNo: number; status: "Waiting" | "Completed" | "Failed"; openWaitHandles: readonly WaitHandle[] }</?t>
    <fact-source ?>Flow definition 是输入事实；snapshot store 是唯一写入口；runtime 只通过 dependency port 使用它。</?>
  ]>
<port #runtime.flow.scheduler {
    kind = "port"
    single_writer = "modeling://runtime/flow/scheduler"
  } [
    <desc ?>scheduler port 承载持久 flow 的 start、resume、deadline、refresh 和 durable child lifecycle。</?>
    <types ?t>interface DurableChildFlowResolver { start(reference: string, childTreeId: string, input: unknown): Promise<unknown>; inspect(reference: string, childTreeId: string): Promise<unknown> }</?t>
  ]>
  <not-owned-here ?>scheduler 的具体实现、snapshot serialization 和 task store 属于 engineering implementation；本节点只定义事实等级和 owner 关系。</?>
